  "contradictory_card_ids": [],
  "decision_summary": "All supplied evidence molecules have numeric oral bioavailability values at or above 20% in ordinary conditions, including multiple absolute bioavailability measurements versus IV in healthy subjects; therefore the prediction is high.",
