    "Some records are from special populations (e.g., cirrhosis, elderly) or use unspecified bioavailability methods; they are consistent with the positive direction but less direct.",
    "Encainide shows a wide interindividual bioavailability range (7-82%) and qualitative low-bioavailability comments in some patients, but the strongest healthy-subject absolute values remain at or above 20%."
